 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Hakyoku Yotei no Akujo no Hazu ga, Reitetsu Koushaku-sama ga Wakaretekuremasen!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "破局予定の悪女のはずが、冷徹公爵様が別れてくれません！"
   },
   {
    "en": "We were supposed to separate... but the cold duke refuses to let me go!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I was reborn inside the world of a novel…\nNot as the heroine, but as a background character even less important than a “backup plan”—\nthe greedy, man-crazy villainess: Grace.\n\nAccording to the story, Grace is supposed to toy with the cold Duke Zane and then abandon him, setting the stage for his destined meeting with the true heroine.\nBut if she doesn’t follow the plot, the story will spiral toward a devastating war, and Grace will die as a result!\n\nTo save herself, Grace decides to stick to her role as the villainess, even if it goes against her true nature.\nThe problem? She was originally a serious and kind-hearted girl, making her utterly terrible at playing the part of a proper villain.\n\nAnd the result?\nInstead of getting heartbroken and moving on as he’s meant to, Duke Zane falls madly in love with her, insisting on staying by her side:\n\n“I’ll never let you go… Don’t expect a goodbye from me.”\n\nCan Grace rewrite her fate…\nOr will this unexpected love turn the entire story upside down?"
  },
